    <entry>
      <title>C++特征杂记</title>
      <link href="/2025/04/07/Cpp%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%E6%9D%82%E8%AE%B0/"/>
      <url>/2025/04/07/Cpp%E7%89%B9%E5%BE%81%E6%9D%82%E8%AE%B0/</url>
      
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/hint.css/2.4.1/hint.min.css"><h3 id="简介">简介</h3><p>关于C++语言特征的个人杂记，以C++11版本为主。 <span id="more"></span></p><h3 id="类">类</h3><h4 id="虚析构函数影响默认移动的生成">虚析构函数影响默认移动的生成</h4><p>直接定义的虚析构函数会影响编译器生成默认的移动，默认继承的则不会。<figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 作为类成员，判断是否生成移动</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">MoveClassInfo</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">MoveClassInfo</span>()=<span class="keyword">default</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">MoveClassInfo</span>(<span class="type">const</span> MoveClassInfo&amp; rf)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&quot;copy con&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; std::endl;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="built_in">MoveClassInfo</span>(MoveClassInfo&amp;&amp; rf)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&quot;move con&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; std::endl;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line">    MoveClassInfo&amp; <span class="keyword">operator</span>=(<span class="type">const</span> MoveClassInfo&amp; rf)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&quot;copy fun&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; std::endl;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> *<span class="keyword">this</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    MoveClassInfo&amp; <span class="keyword">operator</span>=(MoveClassInfo&amp;&amp; rf)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">if</span>(<span class="keyword">this</span>!=&amp;rf)&#123;</span><br><span class="line">            std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&quot;move fun&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; std::endl;</span><br><span class="line">        &#125;</span><br><span class="line">        <span class="keyword">return</span> *<span class="keyword">this</span>;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;</span><br><span class="line">    ~<span class="built_in">MoveClassInfo</span>() = <span class="keyword">default</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure> <figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 基类</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">BaseClass</span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">virtual</span> ~<span class="built_in">BaseClass</span>()&#123;</span><br><span class="line">        std::cout  &lt;&lt; <span class="string">&quot;base delete&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; std::endl;</span><br><span class="line">    &#125;;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure> <figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 派生类</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">class</span> <span class="title class_">DerivedClass</span>: <span class="keyword">public</span> BaseClass&#123;</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">public</span>:</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="comment">// virtual ~DerivedClass() = default; // 是否自定义虚析构函数</span></span><br><span class="line">    MoveClassInfo move_class_info;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure> <figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 测试函数</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function">DerivedClass <span class="title">test_gen</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line">    <span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="built_in">DerivedClass</span>();</span><br><span class="line">&#125;;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="function"><span class="type">int</span> <span class="title">main</span><span class="params">()</span></span>&#123;</span><br><span class="line"></span><br><span class="line"><span class="comment">// 需关闭优化，否则自动优化为一次构造</span></span><br><span class="line">DerivedClass derived_class = <span class="built_in">test_gen</span>();</span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">return</span> <span class="number">0</span>;</span><br><span class="line">&#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>仅继承基类的虚析构函数： <figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">move con     // 函数返回值移动到临时对象</span><br><span class="line">base delete  // test_gen函数运行结束，函数内对象析构</span><br><span class="line">move con     // 临时对象移动到derived_class对象</span><br><span class="line">base delete  // 临时对象析构</span><br><span class="line">base delete  // main运行结束，derived_class对象析构</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure> 自定义虚析构函数：<figure class="highlight plaintext"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><span class="line">copy con    //显然和上面一致，只是编译器不再生成移动函数</span><br><span class="line">base delete</span><br><span class="line">copy con</span><br><span class="line">base delete</span><br><span class="line">base delete</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></p>]]></content>
      
      
      
